  (7, 'Major muscle groups and the roles of muscles', 'During the upward phase of a press-up, which muscle is the agonist at the elbow?', 'Latissimus dorsi', 'Biceps', 'Deltoid', 'Triceps', 'D', 'Pushing up straightens (extends) the elbow, which is done by the triceps. The biceps act as the antagonist.', 'higher', 'applied', 'AO2')
